{
  "id": "JOB.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 20",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then answered Zophar the Naamathite, and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore do my thoughts cause me to answer, and for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "this",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I make haste.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have heard the check of my reproach, and the spirit of my understanding causeth me to answer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Knowest thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "not",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this of old, since man was placed upon earth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That the triumphing of the wicked",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "short, and the joy of the hypocrite",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for a moment?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though his excellency mount up to the heavens, and his head reach unto the clouds;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Yet",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he shall perish for ever like his own dung: they which have seen him shall say, Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall fly away as a dream, and shall not be found: yea, he shall be chased away as a vision of the night.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The eye also",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saw him shall",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "see him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no more; neither shall his place any more behold him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His children shall seek to please the poor, and his hands shall restore their goods.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His bones are full",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of the sin",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of his youth, which shall lie down with him in the dust.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though wickedness be sweet in his mouth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "though",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he hide it under his tongue;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Though",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he spare it, and forsake it not; but keep it still within his mouth:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Yet",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his meat in his bowels is turned,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the gall of asps within him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath swallowed down riches, and he shall vomit them up again: God shall cast them out of his belly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall suck the poison of asps: the viper's tongue shall slay him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall not see the rivers, the floods, the brooks of honey and butter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That which he laboured for shall he restore, and shall not swallow",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "down: according to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "substance",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the restitution",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he shall not rejoice",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "therein",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because he hath oppressed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath forsaken the poor;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "because",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.20.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.20.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he hath violently taken away an house which he builded not;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely he shall not feel quietness in his belly, he shall not save of that which he desired.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There shall none of his meat be left; therefore shall no man look for his goods.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the fulness of his sufficiency he shall be in straits: every hand of the wicked shall come upon him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
